## 2. Grant of Rights (Vetted Partners Only)

Subject to the terms of this License, the Licensor
hereby grants each Vetted Partner a limited,
non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable,
revocable license to:

(a) use, study, and modify the Software for Permitted
Use;

(b) compile, build, and run the Software, and integrate
it with other software under the Licensor's written
permission, for Permitted Use;

(c) reproduce the Software internally for backup,
archival, and reproducibility purposes as required by
Permitted Use;

(d) distribute the Software, in source or compiled
form, **only** to other Vetted Partners, and only for
Permitted Use.

No rights are granted to any person or entity that is
not, at the time of the relevant act, a Vetted Partner.
Without limiting the foregoing, **no rights are granted
to the general public**, and there is no implied license
under copyright, patent, trade secret, or any other
doctrine of intellectual-property law for any non-Vetted-
Partner use.

