## 3. Prohibited Uses

The following are expressly prohibited, regardless of
whether the user is otherwise a Vetted Partner:

3.1. Use of the Software in, or for the benefit of, any
country, territory, or natural/legal person subject to
EU restrictive measures, EU sanctions, or UN sanctions,
or in violation of the EU Dual-Use Regulation
(Regulation (EU) 2021/821) or any successor or equivalent
instrument.

3.2. Use of the Software for any application whose
end-use is prohibited under EU or Member-State law,
including without limitation any application falling
within Article 5 of EU Regulation 2021/821, or under
any applicable arms embargo, anti-torture regulation,
or chemical/biological weapons non-proliferation
obligation.

3.3. Reverse engineering, decompilation, or
disassembly of the Software except to the extent that
such activity is expressly permitted by applicable
non-waivable law, and only for the purpose of
interoperability with independently created software
under a Vetted Partner's control.

3.4. Removal, alteration, or obscuring of any copyright
notice, license header, SPDX-License-Identifier, or
provenance marker in the Software.

3.5. Distribution of the Software to any person or
entity that is not a Vetted Partner at the time of
distribution, including without limitation publishing
the Software on a publicly accessible website, posting
it to a public package registry, or mirroring it on a
public version-control host.

3.6. Use of the Software to provide commercial
aerostructure engineering services to a third party
who is not a Vetted Partner, except under a written
subcontract with the Licensor.

