## 4. Dual-Use Notice

The Licensor acknowledges that the Software is a
dual-use technology within the meaning of EU Regulation
2021/821. The Software is published in the relevant
EU dual-use database as required by Article 11 of that
Regulation. Each Vetted Partner is responsible for
assessing the end-use of any derivative work, export,
or service built on the Software and for obtaining any
authorisations required by applicable export-control
law before transferring the Software, any derivative, or
any technical service related to it outside the EU.

