## 8. Term and Termination

8.1. This License is effective as of the date the
Vetted Partner first accesses, downloads, copies, or
otherwise uses the Software, and continues until
terminated.

8.2. The Licensor may terminate this License with
respect to any Vetted Partner on thirty (30) days'
written notice, or immediately on any material breach
of Section 3 or Section 5.

8.3. A Vetted Partner ceases to be a Vetted Partner
upon (a) removal from the Register by the Licensor,
(b) expiration or termination of the EIC Pathfinder
Grant Agreement, or (c) termination of the Vetted
Partner's written vetted-partner agreement with the
Licensor. Upon cessation, the licence granted by
Section 2 terminates automatically and the former
Vetted Partner must promptly destroy all copies of the
Software in its possession or control, except copies
required to be retained by mandatory non-waivable
law.

8.4. Sections 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 9, 10, and 11 survive
termination of this License.

